msgstr "Diferență la preț de vânzare (371)"

#. module: nexterp_stock_inventory_retail
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:nexterp_stock_inventory_retail.field_l10n_ro_stock_inventory_line__l10n_ro_retail_value
