msgstr "Valoare la preț de vânzare (371)"

#. module: nexterp_stock_inventory_retail
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:nexterp_stock_inventory_retail.field_l10n_ro_stock_inventory_line__l10n_ro_retail_markup_value
msgid ""
"Share of the difference that lands on the commercial markup account, filled "
"together with the cost difference."
msgstr ""
"Partea din diferență care ajunge în contul de adaos comercial, completată "
"odată cu diferența de cost."

#. module: nexterp_stock_inventory_retail
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:nexterp_stock_inventory_retail.field_l10n_ro_stock_inventory_line__l10n_ro_retail_vat_value
msgid ""
"Share of the difference that lands on the deferred VAT account, filled "
"together with the cost difference."
msgstr ""
"Partea din diferență care ajunge în contul de TVA neexigibilă, completată "
"odată cu diferența de cost."

#. module: nexterp_stock_inventory_retail
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:nexterp_stock_inventory_retail.field_l10n_ro_stock_inventory_line__l10n_ro_retail_price
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:nexterp_stock_inventory_retail.report_stock_inventory_document
msgid "Shelf Price"
msgstr "Preț de vânzare"

#. module: nexterp_stock_inventory_retail
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:nexterp_stock_inventory_retail.field_l10n_ro_stock_inventory_line__l10n_ro_retail_price
msgid ""
"Shelf price (PVA, VAT included) the shop currently charges for one unit of "
"this product."
msgstr ""
"Prețul de vânzare cu amănuntul (PVA, cu TVA inclus) practicat în prezent de "
"magazin pentru o unitate din acest produs."

#. module: nexterp_stock_inventory_retail
#: model:ir.model,name:nexterp_stock_inventory_retail.model_l10n_ro_stock_inventory
msgid "Stock Inventory"
msgstr "Inventar stoc"

#. module: nexterp_stock_inventory_retail
#: model:ir.model,name:nexterp_stock_inventory_retail.model_l10n_ro_stock_inventory_line
